WEBVTT

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:34.190
No introduction is needed,
we're Athena's Saints!

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:35.890
What are you here for?

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.440
To protect Athena.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.720
And in the name of Athena...

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:47.960
We'll defeat Hades.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.930
After the big rats, it's the small rats.

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:56.980
We're here to pay back for
everything the Specters have done.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.930
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:12.260
I did it!

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:27.290
The Morning of Resolution

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.290
You are eyesores!

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:53.180
It's our turn now! We'll get you!

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.930
Seiya, you must not fight.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:58.530
Mu.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.600
Andromeda, hold back your chain.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:07.030
Step away, Bronze Saints.

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:13.460
Even if it's the order of the
Gold Saints, we can't step away.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:17.250
Well said, Shiryu. We can't step away.

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:19.380
Fine.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:25.340
Athena's Saints, fall into Cocytus together!

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.100
Mu, stop!

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:46.710
Miro!

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:49.900
Why?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.280
Mu!

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.510
Time has come to finish you off.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:00.030
"Finish us off"?

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.060
Try it if you can.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:12.040
Seiya, I have a favor to ask.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:17.900
Leave this to us and move ahead.

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:20.930
Mu, however...

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:26.400
The Gold Saints will take on the Specters.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:33.040
Go, and help Saga and the others.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:38.890
We can't stop a fight that's started.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.830
We'll defeat him!

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.800
Mu, Miro, Aioria.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.620
Could you be, Mu?

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:53.180
Seiya, have I ever lied?

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.850
All right, Mu.

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:03.970
We'll see you later, Seiya.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:09.880
Let's go, Shun, Hyoga, Shiryu.

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:13.700
It's a promise.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.820
We're counting on it.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:18.520
We'll be waiting.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:31.160
The last stand of the prideful Gold Saints

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:35.020
You didn't want them to see you die.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:40.390
Pride? You are mistaken.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:45.600
We're offering a gift to Athena
in the Underworld before that!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:57.060
Farewell, Gold Saints!

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:59.220
Stardust Revolution!

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.660
Scarlet Needle!

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:03.840
Lightning Plasma!

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.340
Greatest Caution!

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:18.260
Seiya, could Mu and the others have?

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:20.500
Don't say it, Shun.

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:34.430
Mu told us to go ahead and help Saga.

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:40.110
We need to focus on that.

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:41.280
Mmm.

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:42.250
Let's hurry.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:07:00.770
Frog, the Hades Castle
is no longer of any use.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:04.080
I will return to Lord Hades.

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:07.400
Leave the rest to me.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.640
I'll make sure everything goes as planned.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:19.440
Don't get off track.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:38.600
Miss Pandora, you can trust me.
I will take care of everything.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:47.770
Did you hear that, Gold Saints? I am
the ruler of the Hades Castle now!

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:53.340
She's fled because she senses defeat.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:56.200
What are you talking about?

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:00.070
I'll give you your final punishment.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.370
Here, here!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:12.250
This is for trying to make a fool of me.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:17.180
I almost froze to death.

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:20.920
It was so cold!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:25.830
This is what happens when you go against me!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:29.580
How's that? How's that? How's that?

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.300
How's that?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:46.300
Huh?

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:06.470
Camus!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.040
Get up, Saga.

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:14.330
Let's go save Athena together.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.450
I'm sorry.

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:28.540
The real battle is about
to begin and I can't help.

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:31.040
What are you saying, Saga?

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:36.630
Don't forget,

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:43.350
in your arm lives my Excalibur.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:50.340
Don't forget why that sword is there.

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:07.100
Shura.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.270
Athena.

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:20.870
Our goddess.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.620
Camus.

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:43.270
Athena. Our goddess.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:46.320
We entrust her with you.

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:48.810
Saga!

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:58.400
We know.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:02.060
We're not only entrusted with Athena.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:05.470
We're also entrusted with
the spirit of the Saints.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.880
And we won't forget.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:13.370
The Gold Saints who gave up their lives

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.970
for justice.

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:30.000
I'll tell you, Camus, whom
you've kicked around,

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:32.270
is my master!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:36.370
That's what happens when you go against me!

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:38.460
What did you just say?

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.410
Your master?

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:41.850
What?

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:47.330
Miss Pandora, let me go with you!

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:55.280
Master Camus, this attack is for you!

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:58.520
Aurora Execution!

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:01.380
There's nothing to worry about.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:06.550
What can Athena alone do in the Underworld

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:08.530
that Lord Hades rules?

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:16.300
Athena will perish before
she reaches Lord Hades.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.530
Miss Pandora.

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:33.800
Please help me, these
intruders of Hades Castle.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:40.910
Miss Pandora.

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.940
Stop! Who is it?

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:56.950
Wait!

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:21.100
A resemblance to someone like him.

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.150
Wait!

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.230
Wait, Shun.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.240
That's the stairs to the Underworld.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:40.610
Without Lord Hades' protection,
no one can make it through safely

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.320
You are?

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:48.100
You rats never die.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.880
The Gold Saints have long been.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:59.340
Will you throw away your
lives, like the Gold Saints?

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:06.890
The Saint amongst Saints, the Gold Saints.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:10.380
Gold Saints Aioria,

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:15.810
Miro and Mu passed without
putting a scratch on me.

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:19.120
Return to the Sanctuary.

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:23.800
And pray for the poor souls who have passed.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.710
That work is suited for you.

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.510
Poor?

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:35.770
Do you insult the men, who despite being
labeled traitors fought for justice?

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.670
They sacrificed their own flesh.

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:42.640
And protected us.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:46.110
Say what you will about us,

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:50.360
but I will not allow you to
ridicule the Gold Saints!

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:54.610
Even if you won't allow it, it's too late.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:57.410
The Gold Saints are already dead.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:07.010
We, who have taken on the spirit
of the Gold Saints, are here!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.800
We will defeat you!

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.140
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:21.680
Seiya.

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:37.210
Hyoga!

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:59.630
So you can move around, but that's it.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.610
It's your turn.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:10.670
What?

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:17.120
It's your turn to go down.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.030
Give it up.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:26.730
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:32.730
What?

00:17:01.190 --> 00:17:05.270
You scarred my Surplice.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:10.230
You'll have no complaints,
if I crush you here.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.490
Die and regret your helplessness.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:30.460
Nebula Storm!

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.370
Rising Dragon Punch!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:42.250
Aurora Thunder Attack!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:18:01.210
Greatest Caution!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:03.580
I've only used half.

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:08.130
No, not even one hundredth of my energy.

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:11.600
But it's over.

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:16.330
It's no use. Run, Seiya.

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:19.180
That's right, he's too strong.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:22.550
Seiya, we're no match.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.790
I can still hear Mu's voice.

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:30.660
I can feel Saga.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:34.300
Camus' soul.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:38.790
Shura and the others didn't
just die for their sins.

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:50.210
Mu, Miro and Aioria showed us the way.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:55.830
We're weak and useless, but...

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:02.790
We can be proud of the fact
that we don't give up.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.210
What's this?

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:11.080
I feel a wounded but fiercely burning Cosmo.

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:17.850
Let's go!

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:31.400
Are you seriously going to go against me?

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.440
I won't let you!

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.870
They've been blown away.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:10.330
Hmm?

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:24.730
It just begun. We can't lose to you.

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:28.430
We are Athena's Saints.

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:36.700
Pegasus Comet!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:45.150
Could it be, I've been hit?

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:49.400
I am one of The Big Three of the Underworld.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.880
I won't forgive you!

00:21:57.470 --> 00:22:02.130
Greatest Caution!

00:22:12.490 --> 00:22:17.420
I'll show you the true
strength of Athena's Saints.

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:29.560
This is my Cosmo!

00:22:35.840 --> 00:22:37.150
You bastard!

00:22:38.680 --> 00:22:41.610
Burn, my Cosmo!

00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:57.200
Seiya!

00:23:01.590 --> 00:23:02.680
Seiya.

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:10.760
Seiya!

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:32.480
What are you looking at?

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:39.760
The Sanctuary, the entire world.

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:41.540
I see.

00:23:46.120 --> 00:23:52.440
Seiya and the others, had
to fight again after all.

00:23:53.300 --> 00:23:55.360
I need to apologize to them.

00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:58.960
No one could have stopped them.

00:24:00.060 --> 00:24:04.330
I just regret they couldn't
realize their Eighth Sense.

00:24:05.310 --> 00:24:09.720
Shaka's dying message to Athena.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:14.420
Arriving in the Underworld alive.

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:20.190
The only way to proceed, unbound
by the laws of the Underworld.

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:29.650
Above the seven senses all humans possess,

00:24:29.820 --> 00:24:31.280
the Eighth Sense.

00:24:31.860 --> 00:24:34.740
If you awaken to it, it's possible.

00:24:35.510 --> 00:24:41.690
We have realized our Seventh
Sense through battle

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:45.980
and heightened our Cosmo.

00:24:46.700 --> 00:24:48.770
Like Seiya and the others.

00:24:49.110 --> 00:24:52.370
No, they raise their Cosmo even higher.

00:24:52.780 --> 00:24:55.190
They have caused miracles.

00:24:55.920 --> 00:24:59.860
Surely they will realize their Eighth Sense.

00:25:01.390 --> 00:25:04.340
Seiya, I believe.

00:25:05.240 --> 00:25:07.350
Yes. They are alive.

00:25:10.720 --> 00:25:12.020
Us too.

00:25:23.350 --> 00:25:28.880
Dohko, I wish I could stay and talk.

00:25:29.750 --> 00:25:32.700
What? We will soon meet again.

00:25:34.860 --> 00:25:39.620
You're right, we waited 243 years.

00:25:40.300 --> 00:25:44.070
A little more time is nothing.

00:25:52.040 --> 00:25:56.170
Until we meet again, farewell.

00:25:57.030 --> 00:25:58.070
Friend.

00:26:12.050 --> 00:26:13.940
Shall we go, Canon?

00:26:14.270 --> 00:26:16.030
I will go with you.

00:26:38.080 --> 00:26:40.410
Burn your Cosmo to the maximum.

00:26:40.500 --> 00:26:42.570
Cause a miracle.

00:26:42.780 --> 00:26:45.420
We'll see each other alive in the Underworld.
